  "transcript": [
    {
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 23480,
      "text": "[Narrator]: You will hear a number of different recordings, and you will have to answer questions on what"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 23480,
      "endMs": 25280,
      "text": "you hear."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 25280,
      "endMs": 29960,
      "text": "There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions, and you will have a chance"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 29960,
      "endMs": 32400,
      "text": "to check your work."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 32400,
      "endMs": 36880,
      "text": "All the recordings will be played once only."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 36880,
      "endMs": 40240,
      "text": "The test is in four parts."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 40240,
      "endMs": 44480,
      "text": "Write all your answers in the listening question booklet."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 44480,
      "endMs": 49840,
      "text": "At the end of the test, you will be given ten minutes to transfer your answers to an answer"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 49840,
      "endMs": 52440,
      "text": "sheet."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 52440,
      "endMs": 61960,
      "text": "Now turn to part one on page two of your question booklet."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 61960,
      "endMs": 62960,
      "text": "Part one"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 62960,
      "endMs": 69360,
      "text": "You will hear a telephone conversation between a woman and a park ranger."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 69360,
      "endMs": 72840,
      "text": "First you have some time to look at questions one to five."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 82440,
      "endMs": 105400,
      "text": "Now listen carefully and answer questions one to five."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 105400,
      "endMs": 108120,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Almond Valley Poppy Reserve may help you."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 108120,
      "endMs": 110480,
      "text": "[Woman]: Is the nature reserve open now?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 110480,
      "endMs": 115960,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Yes, we are actually open all year, although this is the best time of year to see the wild"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 115960,
      "endMs": 116960,
      "text": "flowers."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 116960,
      "endMs": 119120,
      "text": "[Woman]: Are the poppies blooming yet?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 119120,
      "endMs": 120120,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Absolutely."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 120120,
      "endMs": 124560,
      "text": "They started to bloom last week and are already beautiful, but they should peak and be"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 124560,
      "endMs": 126960,
      "text": "in full bloom at the end of the month."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 126960,
      "endMs": 130920,
      "text": "[Woman]: Oh, I was planning on coming at the end of this week."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 130920,
      "endMs": 132320,
      "text": "Is that too early?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 132320,
      "endMs": 133760,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 133760,
      "endMs": 136200,
      "text": "The hills are already covered with orange poppies."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 136200,
      "endMs": 138680,
      "text": "[Woman]: I thought poppies were red."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 138680,
      "endMs": 140040,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Not in California."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 140080,
      "endMs": 142280,
      "text": "I've never seen a red poppy here."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 142280,
      "endMs": 145120,
      "text": "[Woman]: The poppy reserve is in Ocean County, right?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 145120,
      "endMs": 146120,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Right."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 146120,
      "endMs": 149240,
      "text": "From lakeside, you'll need to drive about an hour east."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 149240,
      "endMs": 151560,
      "text": "[Woman]: What time does the reserve open?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 151560,
      "endMs": 154640,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: The reserve is open from sunrise to sunset."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 154640,
      "endMs": 158800,
      "text": "It's best to come early in the morning to beat the crowds, but for the best photography,"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 158800,
      "endMs": 162440,
      "text": "you might want to consider a mid-afternoon visit on a weekday."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 162440,
      "endMs": 166360,
      "text": "[Woman]: I heard that there are a lot of rattlesnakes in the desert."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 166360,
      "endMs": 168920,
      "text": "Is it dangerous to walk about?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 168920,
      "endMs": 170960,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: This wildlife is quite safe."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 170960,
      "endMs": 176080,
      "text": "There are very few people bitten by rattlesnakes, so we do recommend wearing trousers just"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 176080,
      "endMs": 177760,
      "text": "to be on the safe side."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 177760,
      "endMs": 178920,
      "text": "[Woman]: All right."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 178920,
      "endMs": 182760,
      "text": "I was hoping that I might have the chance to see some wildlife too."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 182760,
      "endMs": 186560,
      "text": "Oh, how much is the admission to the reserve?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 186560,
      "endMs": 188040,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: It's $5."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 188040,
      "endMs": 191600,
      "text": "[Woman]: Can I use my national park pass to enter the reserve?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 191600,
      "endMs": 196200,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Unfortunately not, since it is a state park, not a national park."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 196200,
      "endMs": 197760,
      "text": "[Woman]: All right."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 197800,
      "endMs": 201480,
      "text": "I heard from a friend that there is a nature tour available."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 201480,
      "endMs": 202920,
      "text": "Can you tell me about it?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 202920,
      "endMs": 206240,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Certainly, but can you excuse me just a sec?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 206240,
      "endMs": 207560,
      "text": "I'll be right back."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 207560,
      "endMs": 208560,
      "text": "[Woman]: OK."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 227760,
      "endMs": 246600,
      "text": "[Narrator]: Now listen and answer questions 6 to 10."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 246600,
      "endMs": 247840,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Hello?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 247840,
      "endMs": 252440,
      "text": "[Woman]: Yes, I'm still here."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 252440,
      "endMs": 256280,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Now, you are interested in the nature tours, right?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 256280,
      "endMs": 258600,
      "text": "[Woman]: Oh, there's more than one."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 258600,
      "endMs": 259600,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Yes."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 259600,
      "endMs": 263520,
      "text": "We have the general tour, which is the one your friend may have taken."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 263520,
      "endMs": 266560,
      "text": "But we also have two more specialized tours."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 266560,
      "endMs": 269760,
      "text": "Starting at 7.30 a.m. is our general tour."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 269760,
      "endMs": 271880,
      "text": "That's early for some people, I know."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 271880,
      "endMs": 274000,
      "text": "It's offered every hour, too."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 274000,
      "endMs": 277320,
      "text": "But it's a great time, and it only lasts 30 minutes."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 277320,
      "endMs": 280200,
      "text": "[Woman]: Is that the tour that takes you to the vista points?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 280200,
      "endMs": 285680,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Yes, that is one of the highlights, along with a film introducing the park and the museum."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 285680,
      "endMs": 288440,
      "text": "You're welcome to tour the museum at your leisure."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 288440,
      "endMs": 293040,
      "text": "It's a great tour for those who just want to take panoramic pictures with automatic cameras."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 293040,
      "endMs": 298600,
      "text": "[Woman]: Well, if I come all that way, I'd like to have a more detailed tour."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 298600,
      "endMs": 304640,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Then you are in luck because we have a wonderful wildflower tour every two hours from 8 a.m."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 304640,
      "endMs": 308960,
      "text": "It lasts one hour, and the volunteer will give you information about many of the flowers"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 308960,
      "endMs": 310480,
      "text": "on the reserve."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 310480,
      "endMs": 313840,
      "text": "[Woman]: Besides the poppies, will cream cups be in bloom?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 313880,
      "endMs": 317160,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Yes, and you will see lots of sage, too."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 317160,
      "endMs": 321520,
      "text": "We have a volunteer who is really good at giving tips on close-up photography."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 321520,
      "endMs": 323760,
      "text": "[Woman]: You mentioned another tour."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 323760,
      "endMs": 329920,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Yes, the last one is the wildlife tour, but it is offered at very limited times."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 329920,
      "endMs": 333360,
      "text": "[Woman]: Is that because most of the wildlife is nocturnal?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 333360,
      "endMs": 339480,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Yes, so we offer this tour only two times, 5.30 a.m. or 7.00 p.m."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 339480,
      "endMs": 345040,
      "text": "[Woman]: Wow, that early, but don't the snakes and lizards like the sun?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 345040,
      "endMs": 346040,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Right."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 346040,
      "endMs": 349720,
      "text": "First let me say it takes about an hour and a half, but you will have the opportunity to"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 349720,
      "endMs": 354040,
      "text": "see other animals like coyotes, quail, and roadrunners."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 354040,
      "endMs": 358400,
      "text": "You have to get here before the crowds arrive or after most of them leave."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 358400,
      "endMs": 359800,
      "text": "[Woman]: Well, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 359800,
      "endMs": 363080,
      "text": "Does it require a lot of walking?"
    },
    {
      "startMs": 363080,
      "endMs": 368320,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: More like a lot of standing, but most of the time you will be at one or two locations."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 368320,
      "endMs": 372640,
      "text": "So we recommend bringing a tripod and zoom lens if you want to take pictures."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 372640,
      "endMs": 375160,
      "text": "[Woman]: Well, thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 375160,
      "endMs": 378440,
      "text": "You've been extremely helpful and informative."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 378440,
      "endMs": 379440,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: You're welcome."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 379440,
      "endMs": 380680,
      "text": "Glad I could be of service."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 380680,
      "endMs": 381680,
      "text": "[Woman]: Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 381680,
      "endMs": 382440,
      "text": "[Park Ranger]: Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 382440,
      "endMs": 388160,
      "text": "[Narrator]: That is the end of Part 1."
    },
    {
      "startMs": 388160,
      "endMs": 391760,
      "text": "You now have one minute to check your answers to Part 1."
    }
  ],
